WEBVTT

00:21.920 --> 00:24.440
Ruyang's dance was truly captivating.

00:27.230 --> 00:29.870
Who is next to perform?

00:38.110 --> 00:39.600
- I'm Hu Yingrao.
- I'm Gu Qingshu.

00:39.600 --> 00:41.984
- We offer this dance to Your Majesty.
- We offer this dance to Your Majesty.

01:24.510 --> 01:25.200
Wonderful!

01:25.840 --> 01:26.870
Well danced!

01:29.710 --> 01:32.480
Why are you wearing a veil?

01:33.840 --> 01:34.950
Your Majesty,

01:35.400 --> 01:37.150
a rash suddenly broke out on my face.

01:37.248 --> 01:38.760
That's why I covered it with a veil.

01:38.840 --> 01:40.840
Please forgive my disrespect.

01:42.280 --> 01:44.310
(The verbena must've
been meant for her.)

01:47.040 --> 01:48.760
You performed despite being unwell.

01:48.760 --> 01:50.150
You've done nothing wrong.

01:50.430 --> 01:51.230
Rise,

01:51.400 --> 01:52.280
both of you.

01:52.384 --> 01:53.968
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

01:54.000 --> 01:56.070
That was the most unusual dance.

01:56.070 --> 01:57.920
Did you two choreograph it?

01:58.310 --> 01:59.280
Your Majesty,

01:59.590 --> 02:01.560
Yingrao choreographed it all by herself.

02:03.430 --> 02:05.230
Qingshu is a gifted musician.

02:05.310 --> 02:07.040
She composed the music for me.

02:07.790 --> 02:08.870
Qingshu,

02:09.030 --> 02:11.310
you really are a thoughtful young lady.

02:12.000 --> 02:14.190
I hadn't been sleeping well lately.

02:14.960 --> 02:16.680
Your sachet has been a great help.

02:16.960 --> 02:18.630
By hanging it in my bedchamber,

02:18.630 --> 02:21.590
I've finally been sleeping soundly.

02:22.430 --> 02:23.520
Your Majesty,

02:23.710 --> 02:25.080
I filled the sachet

02:25.080 --> 02:26.870
with a calming incense that aids sleep.

02:27.310 --> 02:28.960
Once its fragrance fades,

02:29.080 --> 02:30.870
I'll embroider another for you.

02:31.470 --> 02:32.030
Sit.

02:32.150 --> 02:32.910
Please, sit down.

04:23.056 --> 04:23.840
=Blossoms of Power=

04:23.840 --> 04:26.820
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

04:26.900 --> 04:29.860
=Episode 22=

04:35.360 --> 04:36.600
Please wait, Your Highness.

04:43.630 --> 04:44.560
Princess Ruyang.

04:45.950 --> 04:48.240
I haven't had the chance
to congratulate you

04:48.430 --> 04:49.870
on your marriage to His Highness.

04:50.310 --> 04:51.800
Since we rarely have a chance to meet,

04:51.800 --> 04:54.360
I've had tea prepared
in the imperial garden.

04:54.600 --> 04:57.630
Would you do me the honor of joining me?

05:00.120 --> 05:01.630
I'd be delighted.

05:06.480 --> 05:08.310
I've long admired you

05:08.430 --> 05:09.430
and wanted to meet you.

05:10.360 --> 05:12.800
If I could learn even
a little of your grace,

05:13.070 --> 05:15.430
it would serve me well
for years to come.

05:15.856 --> 05:17.296
Your Highness, you flatter me.

05:18.120 --> 05:20.390
Crown Prince has arrived.

05:24.896 --> 05:26.176
There's no need for formalities.

05:28.270 --> 05:30.000
What brings you to the imperial garden?

05:30.600 --> 05:31.600
I had some time to spare,

05:31.830 --> 05:32.830
so I came for a stroll.

05:32.976 --> 05:34.560
I didn't expect to find you both here.

05:34.920 --> 05:37.240
I heard about the exam fraud case.

05:37.390 --> 05:40.680
You tightened the rules and introduced
a separate system to flag papers

05:40.768 --> 05:43.750
from candidates with no officials
in their families for three generations,

05:43.792 --> 05:46.300
ensuring they received at least
30 percent of the placements.

05:46.320 --> 05:48.960
It's greatly encouraged candidates
from humble backgrounds.

05:49.408 --> 05:51.056
I must say, I truly admire you.

05:52.480 --> 05:54.120
I recently acquired some excellent tea.

05:54.120 --> 05:55.310
We can all enjoy it together.

05:55.720 --> 05:57.560
Your Highnesses,

05:57.648 --> 05:58.832
this way, please.

06:33.040 --> 06:35.560
I used to think spring water
was best for making tea,

06:35.800 --> 06:38.830
but then I learned that
rainwater is even better.

06:39.070 --> 06:40.270
This rainwater

06:40.270 --> 06:41.680
is collected during rainfall

06:41.800 --> 06:43.800
using a rather elaborate process.

06:45.510 --> 06:46.680
When it's used to make tea,

06:46.992 --> 06:48.190
it leaves no scale in the pot

06:48.630 --> 06:49.600
or stains in the cups.

06:52.750 --> 06:54.430
You know your tea, Your Highness.

06:56.270 --> 06:57.240
Forgive me for asking,

06:58.480 --> 07:00.390
but are you and His Highness

07:00.390 --> 07:01.560
particularly close?

07:04.360 --> 07:05.920
What makes you ask?

07:06.830 --> 07:09.040
The way you prepare tea

07:09.190 --> 07:10.720
is remarkably similar to his.

07:11.070 --> 07:13.360
Even your tea sets are identical.

07:13.680 --> 07:15.240
You have a keen eye.

07:15.720 --> 07:16.600
I did pick up

07:16.920 --> 07:19.510
a few tea-making techniques
from Huayong.

07:19.950 --> 07:21.480
But we rarely see each other.

07:21.920 --> 07:24.040
My mother is His Majesty's cousin,

07:24.144 --> 07:26.016
so His Highness and I are cousins too.

07:33.510 --> 07:35.190
Looks like you often

07:35.190 --> 07:37.630
make tea for
Crown Princess yourself.

07:38.360 --> 07:39.560
How enviable.

07:50.560 --> 07:51.480
This tea

07:51.750 --> 07:53.680
has a rather distinctive fragrance.

07:55.070 --> 07:56.750
Did you add spices to it?

07:59.360 --> 08:02.240
The spices aren't added
while the tea is brewing.

08:02.430 --> 08:03.920
Instead, the tea cakes

08:03.920 --> 08:05.950
are roasted together with the spices.

08:06.630 --> 08:09.000
Once infused with the fragrance,
they're ground into powder.

08:10.920 --> 08:11.870
I see.

08:13.070 --> 08:14.430
I should try making tea

08:14.750 --> 08:15.750
this way sometime.

08:23.720 --> 08:25.190
You brewed this tea for too long.

08:26.240 --> 08:27.190
It tastes bitter,

08:27.568 --> 08:29.360
and its fragrance has turned stale.

08:31.390 --> 08:32.910
Thank you for your guidance.

08:33.000 --> 08:35.320
I'll be more careful next time.

08:37.104 --> 08:38.460
I have other matters to attend to,

08:38.510 --> 08:39.750
so I won't impose any longer.

08:40.670 --> 08:42.960
Then I'll visit you another day.

08:43.200 --> 08:44.200
I'll stay a while longer

08:44.464 --> 08:46.592
and teach Ruyang how
to prepare tea properly.

08:52.440 --> 08:53.030
All right.

09:05.440 --> 09:06.030
Ruyang,

09:06.608 --> 09:07.480
you shouldn't have

09:08.200 --> 09:10.320
deliberately used the same tea set
as mine today

09:10.400 --> 09:12.368
and given the Crown Princess
the wrong idea.

09:12.910 --> 09:14.080
Please forgive me.

09:14.150 --> 09:16.000
I did overstep today.

09:16.480 --> 09:18.510
But I only wanted to see

09:18.670 --> 09:20.390
what kind of lady

09:20.480 --> 09:22.390
could capture your heart.

09:25.320 --> 09:26.750
For your mother's sake,

09:26.840 --> 09:27.870
I'll let this go.

09:27.870 --> 09:28.670
Don't do it again.

09:31.870 --> 09:32.910
It seems

09:33.510 --> 09:35.150
your feelings for the Crown Princess

09:35.440 --> 09:36.910
run very deep indeed.

09:39.320 --> 09:41.480
I've always treated you like my sister.

09:42.320 --> 09:43.720
You're 20,

09:43.720 --> 09:45.296
which is considered late to marry.

09:46.030 --> 09:48.240
I hope you find a husband soon.

09:48.480 --> 09:49.240
Huayong,

09:50.200 --> 09:52.910
I've loved you since I met you
at Luotian Temple

09:53.240 --> 09:54.840
when I was 14.

09:55.790 --> 09:57.616
I've turned down countless proposals

09:57.620 --> 09:59.750
and waited faithfully for
you to return to the capital

09:59.750 --> 10:01.000
until I turned 20.

10:01.270 --> 10:03.790
I've endured endless
ridicule and mockery,

10:04.440 --> 10:05.600
but I've never regretted it.

10:07.440 --> 10:09.150
As long as I can be by your side,

10:10.030 --> 10:11.390
even as your consort,

10:12.200 --> 10:13.630
I'd gladly accept it.

10:15.776 --> 10:17.360
Don't waste any more of your life on me.

10:17.472 --> 10:19.424
I'll have only one wife
for the rest of my life,

10:19.440 --> 10:20.360
and that's Xihe.

10:21.280 --> 10:23.240
But when the Crown Princess
saw the tea set,

10:23.870 --> 10:25.320
she didn't seem jealous at all.

10:26.550 --> 10:27.750
Who says she wasn't jealous?

10:28.840 --> 10:30.870
My Crown Princess is quite
the jealous one.

10:45.216 --> 10:47.200
Your Highness,
it's still chilly in early spring.

10:47.312 --> 10:49.344
Shall I light some
warming incense for you?

10:49.630 --> 10:50.320
No need.

10:50.550 --> 10:52.200
The weather is perfectly pleasant today.

10:53.440 --> 10:55.480
The Crown Princess made it herself.

10:55.750 --> 10:56.630
If you don't want it,

10:56.630 --> 10:57.480
I'll return it to her.

11:00.550 --> 11:01.150
Light it.

11:02.192 --> 11:03.030
Yes, Your Highness.

11:07.664 --> 11:09.680
Has something good happened,
Your Highness?

11:13.270 --> 11:14.480
Something wonderful.

11:15.600 --> 11:16.720
My Crown Princess

11:17.550 --> 11:18.790
is utterly adorable.

11:21.536 --> 11:22.360
One more thing.

11:22.496 --> 11:25.410
Throw out that begonia-shaped tea set
with the twin-fish design.

11:25.440 --> 11:27.984
I don't ever want to see
an identical set in my palace again.

11:28.128 --> 11:29.008
Yes, Your Highness.

11:48.390 --> 11:51.600
Greetings, Crown Princess.

11:51.790 --> 11:52.750
Crown Princess!

11:52.870 --> 11:56.000
Greetings, Crown Princess.

11:58.600 --> 11:59.670
Your Highness,

11:59.750 --> 12:01.320
where did this parrot come from?

12:01.320 --> 12:02.390
It's so clever.

12:02.790 --> 12:04.360
It was a tribute from Java,

12:04.496 --> 12:06.576
brought here to entertain
the Crown Princess.

12:07.120 --> 12:09.600
I'd heard that parrots
could mimic human speech,

12:09.670 --> 12:11.120
but I'd never seen one in person.

12:11.390 --> 12:13.080
It speaks so clearly.

12:13.104 --> 12:15.664
Your Highness, you must've put
a lot of effort into training it.

12:15.720 --> 12:16.600
Of course.

12:16.768 --> 12:19.040
When it comes to making
the Crown Princess happy,

12:19.240 --> 12:20.960
His Highness spares no effort.

12:21.960 --> 12:24.630
Youyou and Luming, united forever.

12:25.120 --> 12:28.080
Youyou and Luming, united forever.

12:29.360 --> 12:32.270
Youyou and Luming, united forever.

12:33.550 --> 12:34.720
What a perceptive bird.

12:34.720 --> 12:36.200
Xihe loves me.

12:38.480 --> 12:40.080
This bird isn't fully trained yet.

12:40.150 --> 12:42.270
I'll take it back and
train it some more.

12:43.200 --> 12:44.270
This is your gift to me,

12:44.390 --> 12:45.200
and I accept it.

12:46.120 --> 12:47.270
It's mine now.

12:47.630 --> 12:49.200
Xihe is mine.

12:58.390 --> 12:59.600
I never knew

12:59.750 --> 13:01.240
you were such a dreamer.

13:02.440 --> 13:03.630
If a man goes through life

13:04.080 --> 13:05.510
without hopes or aspirations,

13:06.080 --> 13:08.000
he may as well be a walking corpse.

13:08.480 --> 13:10.320
I'm bored and blue.

13:10.440 --> 13:12.630
A day without Xihe is just unbearable.

13:17.000 --> 13:18.550
Tian Yuan, take it away.

13:20.030 --> 13:21.200
If you're angry,

13:21.200 --> 13:23.270
no matter the reason, it's my fault.

13:25.270 --> 13:26.840
All I wish for in this life

13:26.928 --> 13:28.528
is to spend every day by your side,

13:29.080 --> 13:30.120
happy and at peace.

13:32.360 --> 13:34.870
It's March, and the peach
blossoms are in full bloom.

13:34.870 --> 13:36.080
We're newlyweds,

13:36.910 --> 13:38.200
so I'd like to take you

13:38.360 --> 13:40.080
on a spring outing to Qujiang tomorrow.

13:40.720 --> 13:42.750
Would you do me the honor?

14:34.112 --> 14:35.270
When you draw the bow,

14:36.270 --> 14:38.150
turn your head toward your target.

14:39.008 --> 14:40.240
Keep both your drawing hand

14:41.200 --> 14:42.390
and the hand holding the bow

14:42.870 --> 14:44.240
level with your eyes.

14:57.150 --> 14:58.320
It seems I

14:58.840 --> 15:00.440
have little talent for archery.

15:00.500 --> 15:02.390
I'll have a training ground
built in my palace

15:02.390 --> 15:04.120
and teach you riding and archery.

15:35.080 --> 15:36.030
The deer call sweetly.

15:36.670 --> 15:37.960
How could I possibly harm one?

15:38.750 --> 15:39.670
Whatever you cherish

15:40.790 --> 15:42.000
is mine to protect.

15:44.750 --> 15:45.790
I'll hold you

15:46.080 --> 15:46.870
to your word.

15:52.320 --> 15:54.240
Her Highness has truly changed.

15:55.240 --> 15:56.030
How has she changed?

15:57.320 --> 15:59.440
She's so cheerful and radiant now,

15:59.630 --> 16:00.910
without a care in the world.

16:01.080 --> 16:04.120
She no longer looks as cold
and distant as she once did.

16:05.120 --> 16:06.480
It's all thanks to His Highness.

16:29.120 --> 16:29.790
Young Lady,

16:29.808 --> 16:31.200
everything has been taken care of.

16:46.630 --> 16:47.270
Father.

16:48.320 --> 16:48.910
Mother.

16:49.870 --> 16:51.270
I can't marry Prince Ning.

16:52.150 --> 16:52.630
I...

16:53.870 --> 16:55.790
I'm no longer a virgin.

16:57.200 --> 16:57.630
What...

17:00.630 --> 17:01.200
What?

17:05.920 --> 17:06.920
What did you just say?

17:07.550 --> 17:08.000
I...

17:08.880 --> 17:09.830
How could you...

17:13.030 --> 17:14.310
You disgrace!

17:14.830 --> 17:16.030
You disgrace!

17:16.440 --> 17:17.200
Honey!

17:18.830 --> 17:19.550
Honey!

17:19.550 --> 17:20.000
Father!

17:20.270 --> 17:20.830
Father!

17:20.830 --> 17:21.550
Honey!

17:21.640 --> 17:22.680
Honey!

17:40.000 --> 17:41.030
Qingshu,

17:42.110 --> 17:42.880
these

17:43.830 --> 17:44.830
are all yours now.

17:45.664 --> 17:47.000
You're giving them to me?

17:55.160 --> 17:56.270
I can't accept all this.

17:59.750 --> 18:01.160
I lost my virginity before marriage.

18:01.550 --> 18:02.960
Now I can't marry,

18:03.720 --> 18:04.640
can't run away,

18:04.912 --> 18:06.416
and can't even take my own life,

18:06.672 --> 18:08.640
because it would implicate
my entire family.

18:08.816 --> 18:10.400
Father told me to pretend to be ill.

18:11.070 --> 18:13.110
In a few days, he'll have
a physician play along

18:14.200 --> 18:15.790
and claim I've contracted consumption.

18:18.384 --> 18:20.176
They'll use my illness
to end the engagement.

18:21.030 --> 18:22.030
After a few years,

18:22.790 --> 18:24.240
they'll send me to a convent

18:25.296 --> 18:27.152
to live out the rest
of my miserable life.

18:28.480 --> 18:29.200
Yingrao,

18:30.528 --> 18:31.750
can you really accept that?

18:34.550 --> 18:35.920
What choice do I have?

18:38.400 --> 18:39.750
When you invited me

18:40.000 --> 18:41.550
to the Jielu Poetry Gathering,

18:43.350 --> 18:44.750
I met Young Master Wen.

18:46.720 --> 18:48.480
I fell for him at first sight.

18:49.200 --> 18:51.030
We met in secret a few
more times afterward,

18:52.720 --> 18:54.550
but we never crossed
the bounds of propriety.

18:54.944 --> 18:56.704
I don't know what came over me that day.

18:56.880 --> 18:58.944
Perhaps the intoxicating
scent of the flowers...

18:59.720 --> 19:01.110
In a moment of passion, we...

19:02.200 --> 19:03.510
I deserve to die!

19:04.960 --> 19:06.830
How could loving someone be a sin?

19:14.480 --> 19:15.160
Yingrao,

19:16.000 --> 19:16.920
what if

19:17.400 --> 19:18.510
I had a way

19:19.110 --> 19:20.640
to preserve your reputation,

19:21.000 --> 19:23.310
honorably end your
engagement to the Second Prince,

19:23.590 --> 19:25.750
and let you be with Young Master Wen?

19:27.070 --> 19:28.400
Would you be willing to risk it?

19:29.590 --> 19:31.550
Is there really such a perfect plan?

19:36.720 --> 19:37.350
Yingrao,

19:38.110 --> 19:40.160
this drug will stop
your pulse completely.

19:40.830 --> 19:42.160
Even an imperial physician

19:42.590 --> 19:44.240
won't be able to tell anything is amiss.

19:45.160 --> 19:46.350
You'll wake up on your own

19:46.720 --> 19:48.030
three days later.

19:48.720 --> 19:50.070
You want me to fake my death?

19:51.240 --> 19:53.440
When His Highness
visits Ningchun Garden,

19:53.830 --> 19:55.200
I'll have someone ambush him.

19:55.200 --> 19:57.130
All you have to do is
take this drug beforehand

19:57.160 --> 19:59.350
and pretend you were
killed saving his life.

19:59.360 --> 20:01.410
Then you can vanish from
the capital without a trace

20:01.424 --> 20:03.240
and start a new life
with Young Master Wen.

20:03.350 --> 20:04.200
That way,

20:04.270 --> 20:06.750
the Second Prince will owe
your family a debt of gratitude.

20:07.270 --> 20:08.030
And you

20:09.070 --> 20:10.830
won't have let your family down.

20:15.680 --> 20:16.680
Qingshu,

20:17.510 --> 20:19.270
thank you for everything
you've done for me.

20:19.720 --> 20:21.510
But the Second Prince is, after all.

20:22.064 --> 20:24.384
I'm willing to marry
the Second Prince in your place.

20:25.200 --> 20:27.790
That way, even if something does
go wrong in the future,

20:28.240 --> 20:30.160
I'll be able to protect
you as a princess

20:30.272 --> 20:31.510
and protect your family, too.

20:31.640 --> 20:33.110
I know you've never

20:33.110 --> 20:35.350
had any feelings for the Second Prince.

20:35.960 --> 20:37.590
You've done more than enough for me.

20:38.070 --> 20:39.680
I don't want you

20:40.000 --> 20:42.128
to sacrifice your lifelong
happiness for my sake.

20:43.760 --> 20:45.590
As the daughter of a convicted official,

20:45.664 --> 20:46.830
I was shunned by everyone.

20:47.240 --> 20:49.240
Now even my brother-in-law
no longer protects me.

20:49.590 --> 20:50.640
Only you

20:50.864 --> 20:53.000
still treat me as you did
when we were children.

20:55.200 --> 20:56.160
If you leave,

20:56.224 --> 20:58.240
I'll have no one left
to rely on in the capital.

20:59.072 --> 21:00.680
Rather than let others mistreat me,

21:00.690 --> 21:02.990
I'd rather fulfill your duty
to your parents in your place

21:03.350 --> 21:05.110
and secure a future for myself as well.

21:07.590 --> 21:08.510
This way, the two of us

21:08.880 --> 21:10.480
can each have the life we want.

21:11.240 --> 21:12.550
Are you certain about this?

21:18.720 --> 21:19.830
(Yingrao,)

21:19.984 --> 21:22.480
(you don't know what it's like
to be scorned and humiliated.)

21:22.750 --> 21:24.200
(Since power means so little to you,)

21:24.480 --> 21:25.720
(let me have it then.)

21:38.680 --> 21:39.440
Yingrao, look.

21:40.000 --> 21:41.720
Has that flower just bloomed?

21:42.590 --> 21:43.350
It's beautiful.

21:47.300 --> 21:49.504
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

21:49.550 --> 21:52.110
Young Lady Hu, Young Lady Gu.

21:52.144 --> 21:53.152
What a coincidence.

21:53.480 --> 21:54.350
We didn't expect

21:54.350 --> 21:56.790
to run into you here
today, Your Highness.

21:57.008 --> 21:59.590
The maple leaves in Ningchun Garden
are beautiful right now.

21:59.720 --> 22:01.750
Yingrao and I were
just going to see them.

22:02.070 --> 22:04.480
Would you care to join us,
Your Highness?

22:04.880 --> 22:06.030
It would be my pleasure.

22:06.270 --> 22:07.000
Ladies,

22:07.880 --> 22:08.590
this way, please.

22:29.440 --> 22:30.440
Your Highness.

22:33.350 --> 22:34.920
There's something in your hair.

22:35.440 --> 22:36.350
Let me get it for you.

22:38.200 --> 22:38.880
Thank you.

22:50.480 --> 22:51.240
Watch out!

22:53.440 --> 22:54.350
Young Lady Hu!

22:54.640 --> 22:55.550
Young Lady Hu!

22:55.550 --> 22:56.240
Yingrao!

22:56.240 --> 22:57.200
Guards!

22:57.200 --> 22:57.960
Assassins!

22:57.960 --> 22:58.790
Someone come quickly!

22:58.790 --> 22:59.440
Young Lady Hu!

22:59.440 --> 23:00.000
Yingrao...

23:00.640 --> 23:02.070
You were hurt protecting me.

23:02.160 --> 23:03.750
I won't let anything happen to you.

23:04.480 --> 23:05.960
Don't blame yourself.

23:06.550 --> 23:07.550
I did this

23:08.240 --> 23:10.070
of my own free will.

23:11.830 --> 23:13.110
Your Highness,

23:13.240 --> 23:14.880
not being able to marry you

23:15.510 --> 23:18.510
is my greatest regret in this life.

23:19.960 --> 23:20.960
Qingshu

23:21.720 --> 23:23.720
is like a sister to me.

23:24.070 --> 23:28.000
Your Highness, I beg you
to grant my final wish.

23:28.680 --> 23:31.030
Let her marry you in my place.

23:31.440 --> 23:31.830
But...

23:32.680 --> 23:35.310
Let her fulfill the wish I never could.

23:35.640 --> 23:36.750
Please, Your Highness.

23:36.750 --> 23:38.240
All right. I promise.

23:38.590 --> 23:40.030
I'll grant you anything you ask.

23:40.920 --> 23:41.550
Yingrao!

23:44.480 --> 23:45.070
Yingrao!

23:45.720 --> 23:46.590
Get a physician!

23:47.640 --> 23:48.680
Get a physician!

23:58.750 --> 23:59.550
Yingrao!

24:00.440 --> 24:01.160
Yingrao!

24:01.590 --> 24:02.830
Please stay with me!

24:03.350 --> 24:04.270
Yingrao!

24:04.920 --> 24:06.590
Please!

24:06.880 --> 24:08.350
Please stay with me, Yingrao!

24:11.110 --> 24:12.510
Yingrao!

24:16.540 --> 24:19.860
(Serene and Clear)

24:19.870 --> 24:22.100
As soon as Young Lady Hu's
seven-day mourning period ended,

24:22.110 --> 24:24.260
Prince Ning asked the Empress Dowager
to arrange a marriage

24:24.272 --> 24:25.200
to fulfill her dying wish

24:25.350 --> 24:27.000
and make Gu Qingshu his new wife.

24:27.510 --> 24:29.550
The match was secured
at the cost of a life,

24:29.550 --> 24:31.250
and it was endorsed by
the Empress Dowager.

24:31.400 --> 24:33.510
Naturally, His Majesty
had no reason to refuse.

24:33.590 --> 24:35.350
The Hu family even had Gu Qingshu

24:35.350 --> 24:36.830
officially adopted by Madam Hu.

24:36.880 --> 24:39.200
She's no longer a concubine-born
daughter of the Gu family,

24:39.200 --> 24:40.670
but a legitimate daughter
of the Hu family.

24:40.680 --> 24:42.590
However, because the family
is still in mourning,

24:42.608 --> 24:44.450
the wedding must be
postponed for three months.

24:45.510 --> 24:47.200
How did I never realize before

24:47.960 --> 24:50.510
just how ruthless Gu Qingshu could be?

24:54.440 --> 24:55.750
Are you saying

24:56.350 --> 24:57.510
there may be more

24:57.750 --> 24:58.750
to Hu Yingrao's death?

24:59.510 --> 25:00.880
For now, it's only a suspicion.

25:02.270 --> 25:04.400
Gu Qingshu likes to
present herself as a savior

25:04.590 --> 25:06.310
to the people she targets.

25:07.240 --> 25:09.680
She wins their trust by
showing them kindness.

25:10.510 --> 25:11.920
But those people never even realize

25:11.968 --> 25:13.350
that every misfortune they suffer

25:13.600 --> 25:15.240
was caused by her in the first place.

25:15.790 --> 25:16.400
By the way,

25:16.410 --> 25:18.590
you asked me to investigate
the roses in Taiji Hall.

25:18.750 --> 25:20.350
It turns out

25:20.350 --> 25:22.960
Gu Qingshu planted
every one of them herself.

25:22.960 --> 25:24.624
She even filled Yong'an Hall with them.

25:25.070 --> 25:26.640
Their fragrance was so overpowering

25:26.640 --> 25:28.070
that it made sleeping difficult,

25:28.270 --> 25:30.200
causing the Empress Dowager's insomnia.

25:30.350 --> 25:31.550
Gu Qingshu then presented her

25:31.550 --> 25:33.232
with a sachet containing
calming incense,

25:33.270 --> 25:34.830
which cured her insomnia.

25:35.184 --> 25:37.536
So she causes the problem,
and then comes to the rescue.

25:37.720 --> 25:39.510
She creates the very mess
she later fixes.

25:39.830 --> 25:41.790
We must investigate
Gu Qingshu thoroughly.

25:42.790 --> 25:45.000
Find everyone connected
to her and Hu Yingrao

25:45.168 --> 25:46.240
and uncover the truth.

25:46.368 --> 25:48.112
- Yes, Your Highness.
- Yes, Your Highness.

26:04.750 --> 26:05.510
Changqing.

26:16.000 --> 26:17.310
I've had little luck in life.

26:18.110 --> 26:19.350
Everyone I've encountered

26:20.310 --> 26:21.750
has treated me heartlessly.

26:21.808 --> 26:23.680
Fortunately, the Empress Dowager
cares for me.

26:24.030 --> 26:25.480
She has now arranged

26:25.590 --> 26:27.640
for me to marry Prince Ning.

26:28.680 --> 26:30.310
I'm on my way to pay my respects to her.

26:31.552 --> 26:32.350
Congratulations.

26:35.070 --> 26:36.440
You once told me

26:37.184 --> 26:38.640
that marrying into the Chu family

26:38.750 --> 26:40.830
was the best someone
like me could hope for.

26:41.240 --> 26:42.200
But now,

26:43.480 --> 26:45.680
I'm about to become
your royal sister-in-law.

26:47.920 --> 26:49.270
I wonder

26:51.510 --> 26:53.070
how you feel about that.

26:55.030 --> 26:56.240
Personally, I think

26:58.160 --> 26:59.920
you've passed up your best chance.

27:12.640 --> 27:14.000
The next time we meet,

27:14.640 --> 27:16.680
you'd better show me proper respect!

27:23.550 --> 27:26.030
I heard you don't care
for overly sweet food,

27:26.590 --> 27:27.680
so I had the kitchen

27:28.240 --> 27:30.070
prepare some lighter pastries for you.

27:30.920 --> 27:31.400
Here.

27:32.200 --> 27:33.400
Try some.

27:34.480 --> 27:35.590
Thank you, Consort Rong.

27:36.384 --> 27:37.790
His Majesty and the Empress Dowager

27:37.790 --> 27:39.480
have always praised your intelligence.

27:40.160 --> 27:41.070
They've even said

27:41.160 --> 27:43.790
that the imperial household
can't be managed without you.

27:44.200 --> 27:45.200
Now that

27:45.270 --> 27:46.790
you and the Crown Prince are married,

27:48.550 --> 27:49.350
I can finally

27:49.440 --> 27:50.880
lighten my burden.

27:52.270 --> 27:54.680
What would you have me do, Consort Rong?

27:54.704 --> 27:55.830
On the fifth of this month,

27:56.030 --> 27:58.350
Fahua Temple will hold
a grand prayer ceremony.

27:59.400 --> 28:01.030
I'd like to entrust

28:01.640 --> 28:03.000
the preparations to you.

28:04.790 --> 28:06.480
It shouldn't be too difficult.

28:07.310 --> 28:09.070
The palace follows
much the same procedure

28:09.070 --> 28:10.160
every year,

28:10.590 --> 28:13.270
so there's no need to worry too much.

28:22.160 --> 28:23.240
This is

28:23.520 --> 28:25.840
the token authorizing you
to command the palace staff.

28:26.380 --> 28:29.220
(Rong)

28:36.340 --> 28:39.020
(Rong)

28:39.030 --> 28:40.624
Thank you for placing your trust in me.

28:41.030 --> 28:43.070
I'll do my best.

28:46.580 --> 28:48.580
(Hanzhang Hall)

28:48.920 --> 28:50.000
Throw all of it away.

28:50.000 --> 28:50.880
Yes, Your Highness.

28:55.270 --> 28:56.000
Your Highness,

28:56.510 --> 28:58.920
why did the Crown Princess
agree so readily

28:59.008 --> 29:00.270
without the slightest suspicion?

29:00.350 --> 29:03.000
Shen Xihe knew the Crown Prince
wouldn't live long,

29:03.280 --> 29:05.680
yet she married into the East Palace
without hesitation.

29:06.640 --> 29:09.880
Her true ambitions
are plain for all to see.

29:10.208 --> 29:12.750
She'll certainly fight for control
of the imperial household.

29:15.270 --> 29:17.160
I was waiting for her
to make the first move,

29:17.750 --> 29:20.110
but she proved far more
patient than I expected.

29:20.550 --> 29:22.070
Then are you planning

29:22.590 --> 29:23.830
to seize the advantage first?

29:24.000 --> 29:25.510
Victory isn't decided

29:25.920 --> 29:27.550
by who strikes first,

29:27.830 --> 29:29.350
but by who lands the decisive blow.

29:37.550 --> 29:38.310
Your Highness,

29:38.384 --> 29:40.790
here are the records you
requested for the prayer ceremony.

29:40.920 --> 29:42.200
They cover the past five years.

29:44.160 --> 29:46.110
Consort Rong said all the right things,

29:46.240 --> 29:48.550
but I can't help feeling
she's up to no good.

29:49.240 --> 29:50.160
I feel the same way.

29:50.830 --> 29:52.240
I just can't figure out

29:52.240 --> 29:53.750
where she'll make her move.

30:02.310 --> 30:03.310
What's wrong?

30:03.552 --> 30:04.830
After a visit to Hanzhang Hall,

30:04.880 --> 30:06.432
you've all returned looking upset.

30:06.680 --> 30:07.510
It's nothing.

30:08.240 --> 30:10.270
I've spoiled these two.

30:10.640 --> 30:12.070
Even the slightest problem

30:12.070 --> 30:13.350
shows all over their faces.

30:14.880 --> 30:15.590
You may leave.

30:22.576 --> 30:23.720
Even if you don't tell me,

30:24.030 --> 30:25.480
I can guess most of what happened.

30:26.240 --> 30:27.750
I'll speak to Changying later

30:27.750 --> 30:29.648
and have him talk some sense
into his mother.

30:29.680 --> 30:31.110
Consort Rong is his mother.

30:32.070 --> 30:33.960
What could he possibly
do to rein her in?

30:34.590 --> 30:35.750
Besides,

30:35.824 --> 30:37.790
this is a struggle within
the imperial harem.

30:38.480 --> 30:40.510
You really shouldn't get involved.

30:40.510 --> 30:41.790
Why shouldn't I get involved

30:41.790 --> 30:43.312
in the affairs of the imperial harem?

30:43.480 --> 30:44.590
We're married.

30:44.880 --> 30:46.310
Anyone who makes an enemy of you

30:46.310 --> 30:47.510
makes an enemy of me.

30:47.760 --> 30:49.030
You've spent all this time

30:49.270 --> 30:51.160
studying the imperial household records.

30:51.712 --> 30:53.350
You didn't start preparing only after

30:53.510 --> 30:54.550
Consort Rong made her move.

30:55.480 --> 30:57.960
The shifting tides of the imperial harem
and the royal court

30:58.200 --> 31:00.350
have always followed the same rules.

31:00.416 --> 31:02.240
Every smile and frown
of an imperial consort

31:02.240 --> 31:04.350
reflects the balance of power at court.

31:05.510 --> 31:07.550
From the moment I decided to marry you,

31:07.750 --> 31:08.590
I knew

31:08.750 --> 31:11.200
that to keep northwest peaceful
and my family safe,

31:11.590 --> 31:12.830
I would have to take control

31:13.310 --> 31:14.440
of the imperial harem.

31:15.000 --> 31:15.830
Besides,

31:15.830 --> 31:18.544
you've been investigating the
poisoning through the royal court.

31:18.750 --> 31:20.680
If I gain control of the imperial harem,

31:21.310 --> 31:23.640
I can search for new clues from within.

31:24.640 --> 31:25.550
So your plans

31:26.290 --> 31:27.310
include me too?

31:27.440 --> 31:28.440
That was our agreement,

31:28.880 --> 31:31.310
to support each other and
help each other succeed.

31:31.310 --> 31:31.830
All right.

31:32.064 --> 31:33.110
We'll do it your way.

32:55.200 --> 32:56.790
What... What happened?

32:59.310 --> 33:00.510
Abbot Xu Qing,

33:01.270 --> 33:03.680
why did His Majesty's incense go out?

33:03.680 --> 33:04.400
Well...

33:04.400 --> 33:05.160
It's all right.

33:06.432 --> 33:08.310
Perhaps the wind is
simply too strong today.

33:09.680 --> 33:10.480
Abbot,

33:11.240 --> 33:12.750
bring me three more incense sticks.

33:13.880 --> 33:15.310
Yes, Your Majesty.

34:01.510 --> 34:02.640
Abbot Xu Qing,

34:03.104 --> 34:04.940
Director of the Imperial
Astronomical Bureau,

34:04.960 --> 34:05.960
Minister of Rites,

34:06.240 --> 34:07.880
this is how you carry out your duties?

34:08.080 --> 34:09.430
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

34:09.440 --> 34:10.760
I failed in my duties.

34:10.840 --> 34:11.960
Please punish me!

34:12.030 --> 34:12.710
Your Majesty,

34:13.480 --> 34:14.630
I am also at fault.

34:15.070 --> 34:15.800
I...

34:16.920 --> 34:18.070
will accept any punishment.

34:24.150 --> 34:24.960
Consort Rong,

34:25.440 --> 34:26.840
what do you mean by this?

34:27.360 --> 34:28.360
Your Majesty,

34:30.480 --> 34:31.760
I thought

34:32.400 --> 34:34.190
the Crown Princess was
exceptionally capable.

34:34.840 --> 34:36.440
That's why I entrusted

34:36.440 --> 34:37.800
this blessing ceremony to her.

34:38.480 --> 34:40.030
But before the gods and Buddhas,

34:40.360 --> 34:42.360
such a suspicious
incident has occurred.

34:43.000 --> 34:44.110
I'm also to blame

34:44.160 --> 34:46.928
for rushing the arrangements
and failing to oversee them properly.

34:47.660 --> 34:48.944
Your Majesty, please mete out

34:49.760 --> 34:50.590
strict punishment.

34:57.800 --> 34:58.800
Your Majesty,

34:59.840 --> 35:02.030
although the incense sticks broke,

35:02.840 --> 35:05.360
you needn't worry about
any rumors of a bad omen.

35:05.920 --> 35:07.070
What do you mean?

35:07.550 --> 35:08.672
I reviewed the procedures

35:08.704 --> 35:10.670
for the past five years'
prayer ceremonies.

35:11.110 --> 35:12.960
Every one of them went smoothly,

35:13.400 --> 35:15.840
yet something went
wrong this year alone.

35:16.800 --> 35:18.030
The only difference this year

35:18.630 --> 35:20.150
is my involvement.

35:21.400 --> 35:23.190
Your Majesty, I ask for permission

35:23.320 --> 35:24.590
to inspect the incense.

35:25.000 --> 35:26.400
If there's nothing wrong with it,

35:26.670 --> 35:28.440
it simply proves I'm unworthy
of my position.

35:28.840 --> 35:30.320
But if it has been tampered with...

35:30.320 --> 35:33.000
It means someone tried to
frame the Crown Princess,

35:33.230 --> 35:34.710
disgrace the imperial family,

35:35.550 --> 35:37.150
and undermine your authority, Father.

35:37.760 --> 35:39.110
They must be severely punished.

35:42.880 --> 35:45.280
Fragrant ingredients form
the core of an incense stick.

35:45.510 --> 35:48.590
They determine the quality
and character of its scent.

35:48.960 --> 35:51.510
In addition, they're mixed with large
amounts of fir powder

35:51.510 --> 35:52.550
or powdered nanmu bark.

35:52.760 --> 35:54.280
A binding agent is then added,

35:54.300 --> 35:55.824
along with saltpeter, to help it burn.

36:08.440 --> 36:10.280
Once lit, a normal incense stick

36:10.280 --> 36:11.320
will burn all the way down

36:11.550 --> 36:12.920
without going out.

36:13.190 --> 36:15.030
Its ash should also be gray.

36:17.920 --> 36:19.710
But the incense His Majesty used

36:19.710 --> 36:21.190
left behind white ash.

36:21.510 --> 36:24.208
When it was lit, it immediately gave off
a shower of sparks

36:24.280 --> 36:25.400
before suddenly going out.

36:25.920 --> 36:28.070
This means these thick incense sticks

36:28.070 --> 36:29.648
contain something that cannot burn.

36:56.630 --> 36:58.000
These are pieces of waste earth,

36:58.000 --> 36:59.670
which cannot burn at all.

36:59.920 --> 37:02.440
They're what caused
the incense to go out.

37:04.440 --> 37:05.590
Please examine them, Abbot.

37:11.230 --> 37:12.110
Your Majesty, this...

37:13.150 --> 37:14.480
This is indeed waste earth.

37:14.480 --> 37:15.504
The ceremonial incense

37:16.360 --> 37:19.150
has always been made under
the supervision of Fahua Temple.

37:19.510 --> 37:21.880
How dare you use such shoddy incense

37:21.880 --> 37:23.480
for the prayer ceremony?

37:23.590 --> 37:24.710
It's all my fault.

37:25.000 --> 37:27.070
Please punish me, Your Majesty.

37:27.104 --> 37:29.280
Arrest every monk involved
in making the incense.

37:29.312 --> 37:30.580
They will be severely punished!

37:30.590 --> 37:32.220
- Yes, Your Majesty.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

37:34.360 --> 37:34.920
Your Majesty,

37:34.930 --> 37:37.000
if the monks who made the
incense did this themselves,

37:37.000 --> 37:38.190
once their actions were exposed,

37:38.190 --> 37:40.304
wouldn't they be bringing
disaster upon themselves?

37:40.630 --> 37:41.710
I believe

37:42.070 --> 37:43.840
they've been framed.

37:43.840 --> 37:44.800
Precisely.

37:45.712 --> 37:47.070
There's more to this waste earth

37:47.320 --> 37:48.590
than meets the eye.

37:49.800 --> 37:50.630
Bring it here.

38:00.480 --> 38:01.590
It's gold dust.

38:01.960 --> 38:02.590
That's right.

38:03.880 --> 38:05.000
My guess is that

38:05.150 --> 38:06.630
whoever tampered with the incense

38:06.710 --> 38:08.320
accidentally mixed in some gold dust.

38:21.510 --> 38:22.440
Your Majesty,

38:22.630 --> 38:24.880
seven monks were responsible
for applying the gold paint.

38:25.000 --> 38:25.920
After questioning them,

38:25.920 --> 38:27.700
we discovered that this man
tampered with the incense.

38:27.710 --> 38:30.060
He also accepted 20 taels of gold
from the palace maid Yu Wan.

38:30.070 --> 38:31.030
Yu Wan?

38:31.630 --> 38:34.320
Isn't she your personal maid?

38:42.840 --> 38:44.550
How could you do such a thing?

38:46.840 --> 38:47.840
I deserve to die!

38:47.960 --> 38:49.190
I deserve to die!

38:49.400 --> 38:51.630
You were devastated
by Duke of Ying's death.

38:51.710 --> 38:53.510
It pained me to see you suffer.

38:53.510 --> 38:55.630
That's why I came to
resent the Crown Princess.

38:55.630 --> 38:57.920
I lost my senses and
made a terrible mistake.

38:57.920 --> 38:59.110
Your Majesty!

38:59.110 --> 39:00.550
Your Majesty, I'm innocent!

39:00.760 --> 39:01.880
You stupid wretch!

39:01.880 --> 39:04.800
You'll be the death of me!

39:04.800 --> 39:05.400
Stop!

39:06.030 --> 39:09.190
Take Yu Wan and this colluding monk

39:09.190 --> 39:10.280
out immediately.

39:10.280 --> 39:11.360
Flog them to death!

39:11.360 --> 39:11.990
- Yes, Your Majesty.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

39:12.070 --> 39:13.800
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

39:13.800 --> 39:14.760
Please forgive me!

39:15.030 --> 39:15.800
Your Highness!

39:15.920 --> 39:16.800
Your Highness!

39:16.920 --> 39:17.480
Your Majesty!

39:17.590 --> 39:19.400
- Move!
- Please forgive me, Your Majesty!

39:19.510 --> 39:20.840
Please show me mercy!

39:20.840 --> 39:22.270
- Father, please show Mother mercy!
- Spare me!

39:22.280 --> 39:24.400
Consort Rong failed to
discipline her servants.

39:24.400 --> 39:25.312
Effective immediately,

39:25.320 --> 39:28.000
she is stripped of her authority
over the imperial harem.

39:28.110 --> 39:29.440
Your Majesty!

39:29.510 --> 39:31.150
I knew nothing about this!

39:31.230 --> 39:33.400
I had no part in it, Your Majesty!

39:33.670 --> 39:35.590
The Empress Dowager is advanced in years

39:35.590 --> 39:36.800
and must not overexert herself.

39:37.030 --> 39:38.190
Effective immediately,

39:38.200 --> 39:39.670
the Crown Princess is hereby appointed

39:39.920 --> 39:42.150
to assist in overseeing
the imperial harem.

39:42.800 --> 39:44.800
Crown Princess, from this day forward,

39:44.864 --> 39:47.200
you must not only maintain
order in the imperial harem,

39:47.400 --> 39:50.280
but also uphold the rules
laid down by our ancestors.

39:53.312 --> 39:54.624
Thank you, Your Majesty.

39:55.110 --> 39:56.960
I will attend to my duties
morning and night,

39:57.440 --> 39:59.150
and share the burdens
of Grandmother.

39:59.800 --> 40:01.110
I won't fail you, Father.

40:27.150 --> 40:28.710
Once you see what I can do,

40:28.720 --> 40:30.760
I'm afraid you'll never
be able to do without me.

40:30.880 --> 40:31.800
I see you as someone

40:31.800 --> 40:33.590
I can weather any storm with.

40:33.800 --> 40:35.400
I don't want to weather storms with you.

40:35.590 --> 40:36.760
I'd rather

40:37.920 --> 40:38.960
share your bed.

40:39.110 --> 40:39.960
What's this?

40:40.230 --> 40:41.150
The line.

40:41.230 --> 40:42.800
If you keep looking at me like that,

40:42.920 --> 40:44.070
I might not be able

40:44.110 --> 40:45.520
to restrain myself much longer.

40:49.591 --> 40:52.531
♪I've hidden so many words♪

40:53.151 --> 40:55.951
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

40:56.821 --> 41:03.791
♪So never uncover♪

41:03.981 --> 41:06.341
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

41:07.471 --> 41:10.201
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

41:11.161 --> 41:16.501
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

41:18.261 --> 41:21.081
♪Every answer I gave♪

41:21.881 --> 41:24.731
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

41:25.521 --> 41:28.891
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

41:29.151 --> 41:32.461
♪How hard it truly was?♪

41:35.431 --> 41:38.871
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

41:39.861 --> 41:42.191
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

41:43.461 --> 41:49.221
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

41:50.631 --> 41:53.761
♪It's a shame I never could♪

41:54.211 --> 41:57.221
♪Give you a moon in return♪

41:57.331 --> 42:03.971
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

42:03.971 --> 42:07.641
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

42:08.511 --> 42:11.271
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

42:11.711 --> 42:14.841
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

42:15.281 --> 42:21.231
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

42:22.631 --> 42:26.181
♪You'll never♪

42:26.461 --> 42:35.931
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

43:02.101 --> 43:05.581
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
